{"id":"c782a953a5846737","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point.md","title":"否定可证性上下文的一致性不动点","display":"ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point — 否定可证性上下文的一致性不动点","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point","aliases":["72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point"],"display":"ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point — 否定可证性上下文的一致性不动点","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]","[[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §4 opening paragraph, print484/PDF496; local finite-model proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point — 否定可证性上下文的一致性不动点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a77c8090d251f76a\" href=\"?note=a77c8090d251f76a\" title=\"72-df-modal-guarded-context\">72-df-modal-guarded-context</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d40b90e274cadbda\" href=\"?note=d40b90e274cadbda\" title=\"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness\">72-thm-gl-finite-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §4 opening paragraph, print484/PDF496; local finite-model proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>；语法、代入、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_m,\\bot_m\">\\(\\top_m,\\bot_m\\)</span> 和保护谓词取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a77c8090d251f76a\" href=\"?note=a77c8090d251f76a\" title=\"72-df-modal-guarded-context\">72-df-modal-guarded-context</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i,B\">\\(A_i,B\\)</span> 由下式构造；使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d40b90e274cadbda\" href=\"?note=d40b90e274cadbda\" title=\"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness\">72-thm-gl-finite-completeness</a> 的有限模型语义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i:=\\neg_m\\Box_m p_i,\\qquad B:=\\neg_m\\Box_m\\bot_m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i:=\\neg_m\\Box_m p_i,\\qquad B:=\\neg_m\\Box_m\\bot_m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A_i)\\land i\\notin\\operatorname{pv}_m(B)\\land\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m A_i[B/p_i]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A_i)\\land i\\notin\\operatorname{pv}_m(B)\\land\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m A_i[B/p_i]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在有限 GL 框架中，B 在一个世界成立恰好表示它有严格后继。若无后继，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box B\">\\(\\Box B\\)</span> 真而 B 假；若有后继，后继集中有极大元，该点没有后继而不满足 B，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box B\">\\(\\Box B\\)</span> 假。两种情况都给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box B\">\\(B\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box B\\)</span>，有限完备性给可证性。该例具体见证存在性，未用上游一般存在定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-guarded-context","status":"resolved","id":"a77c8090d251f76a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-guarded-context","status":"resolved","id":"a77c8090d251f76a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；语法、代入、$\\top_m,\\bot_m$ 和保护谓词取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]。$A_i,B$ 由下式构造；使用 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]] 的有限模型语义。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；语法、代入、$\\top_m,\\bot_m$ 和保护谓词取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]。$A_i,B$ 由下式构造；使用 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]] 的有限模型语义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_m,\\bot_m","display":false},{"tex":"A_i,B","display":false},{"tex":"A_i:=\\neg_m\\Box_m p_i,\\qquad B:=\\neg_m\\Box_m\\bot_m.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A_i)\\land i\\notin\\operatorname{pv}_m(B)\\land\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m A_i[B/p_i]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box B","display":false},{"tex":"B\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box B","display":false}],"bytes":1661,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-541","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"}],"outgoing":["a77c8090d251f76a","d40b90e274cadbda"]}